g   explicit RFC3339 commit time; required when version_control.confirm is enabled, and applied to both the author and the committer date\\n      --cr string            Change Request ID (the element the accepted story_final CR is attached to)\\n  -h, --help                 help for integrate\\n      --revision int         accepted Change Request revision\\n      --rollback             roll back a transaction at phase prepared with trunk unmoved instead of resuming it; available in no other phase\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2269,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 568,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
